  <!-- The screen reader. Listed here so it is enabled the first time it is found: an addon
       shipped in the install folder is otherwise discovered and left disabled, so it never
       starts - and someone who cannot see the screen has no way to reach the addon browser
       to switch it on, which makes the whole build useless to the person it is for.
       Optional deliberately. A non-optional entry that goes missing is LOGFATAL and Kodi
       refuses to start (AddonManager.cpp:136-145), which would turn a damaged addon folder
       into a machine that boots to nothing and cannot say why. Optional entries are still
       enabled on discovery (AddonDatabase.cpp, SyncInstalled) - which is the whole point. -->
  <addon optional="true">service.kodi.screenreader</addon>
</addons>
